| 3 | AT THE MERGE | the rehearsals and the bake. BUILT: the rite walker walked the crossing 23 times on scratch houses (the old image `983c705`, three faces), walk 18 first green on the bundle path, walk 22 on the keep path, walk 23 in the real rite's exact shape at pin `6209acaaf` (parity `par`, the pūlama's admit and unlock, each lent face answering its own view); the source export names `cold-wikis` and `override-bases-unread` over woken wikis, lossless for records, a cold wiki's working rows travelling without their override bases (lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/ruling/2026-11-16); each finding lives in code or canon, the burn's lane commits `e90e9b5e3..efe961c2f` name the scaffolding that went, and the one open item rides the rite's heal list (rank 4f); the operator's new image builds at `6209acaaf`; the walker's crossing leg, its seed and the two-image rehearsal burned at rank 4e. The labelled genesis re-bake BUILT on `develop` (`d9d4ecff0`, 2026-11-18, on the operator's word //"develop should have current genesis seed"//; a second bake reads byte-identical), with the CAS sweep's stored-island guard (`bad53e9c7`). DEFERRED deeply (operator, 2026-11-18, #/rulings): the image and genesis bake per release that lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/project/develop-flow owes rides the first release from `main`, which no lane schedules; one bake, one controller: Lares-Alpha holds the bake and the image | The real house crossed a road a scratch house walked first, and the image the operator stands carries the floor it crossed on. |

